          "text": "inputs: user prompt\n\n\noutputs: specs broken down into\nscopes where they follow the plan\ntemplate: technology, constraints,\napproach, steps/tasks, corner\ncases. scopes: presentation,\nbusiness_logic, ops, datalayer.\nThese scopes should apply to\nfrontend/backend..etc\n\nskills: frontend-architect,backend-\narchitect, cloud-architect, plan-\ntemplate, Designs.md, \n\ngoal: user clarification then detailed\nplan and steps\n\nmodel: claude opus",
